WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.649
Temporal preparation remains important in Spark
Parse raw strings

00:00:05.675 --> 00:00:11.915
into typed dates or timestamps Use Spark SQL date
functions appropriate to that environment

00:00:13.747 --> 00:00:19.236
And always state the output grain For example one
row per event is different from

00:00:19.262 --> 00:00:20.289
one row per month
